                      "message_index": 15,
                      "quoteExcerpt": "\u003creferencable-result>\\nID: 13\\n\",\n      \"type\": \"input_text\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"\\n为您找到1条数据\\n|股票代码|股票简称|最新价|最新涨跌幅|预测净利润中值[20261231]|\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n|002475.SZ|立讯精密|47.59元|-1.73%|214.34亿元|\\n\\n\\n是否能可视化：是\\n\",\n      \"type\": \"input_text\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"\u003c/referencable-result>",
