                      "quoteExcerpt": "\u003creferencable-result>\\nID: 1\\n\",\n      \"type\": \"input_text\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"\\n为您找到3条数据\\n|股票代码|股票简称|最新市净率|\\n|---|---|---|\\n|601933.SH|永辉超市|12.39|\\n|000759.SZ|中百集团|8.27|\\n|002251.SZ|步步高|1.13|\\n\\n\\n是否能可视化：是\\n\",\n      \"type\": \"input_text\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"\u003c/referencable-result>",
